## 6. DevOps Culture & Principles

DevOps is **not just tools** — it's a **mindset**:

### The **CALMS** Framework:
| Letter | Principle | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| **C** | Culture | Break silos between Dev and Ops |
| **A** | Automation | Automate everything possible |
| **L** | Lean | Eliminate waste, work in small batches |
| **M** | Measurement | Measure everything (metrics, KPIs) |
| **S** | Sharing | Share knowledge, responsibility, and tools |

### Key Metrics (DORA Metrics):
| Metric | What It Measures | Elite Teams |
|---|---|---|
| **Deployment Frequency** | How often you deploy | Multiple times per day |
| **Lead Time for Changes** | Code commit to production | Less than 1 hour |
| **Change Failure Rate** | % of deploys causing failure | Less than 5% |
| **Mean Time to Recovery (MTTR)** | Time to recover from failure | Less than 1 hour |

