## 9. DevOps Learning Roadmap

### **Phase 1: Foundations** (1-2 months)
- [ ] Linux basics (commands, file system, permissions)
- [ ] Networking basics (DNS, HTTP, TCP/IP, SSH)
- [ ] Git & version control
- [ ] One programming/scripting language (Python or Bash)

### **Phase 2: Core DevOps** (2-3 months)
- [ ] Docker (containerization)
- [ ] CI/CD (GitHub Actions or GitLab CI)
- [ ] Cloud basics (AWS/Azure/GCP — start with one)
- [ ] Basic monitoring (Prometheus + Grafana)

### **Phase 3: Advanced** (3-4 months)
- [ ] Kubernetes (container orchestration)
- [ ] Terraform (Infrastructure as Code)
- [ ] Ansible (configuration management)
- [ ] Advanced networking & security

### **Phase 4: Expert** (ongoing)
- [ ] Service mesh (Istio, Linkerd)
- [ ] GitOps (ArgoCD, Flux)
- [ ] Platform Engineering
- [ ] Chaos Engineering (Chaos Monkey)
- [ ] DevSecOps practices

